{"3909810": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dragged Deep", "steam_appid": 3909810, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Wishlist</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909810/extras/cad8cfcfb05908b99a9f8a5146bc2992.avif?t=1756515603\" width=700 height=250 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Syracuse Police Dept. Recovered Footage_012 **CLASSIFIED</strong>**</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909810/extras/9fab49dc963b7c6b3ae71f5e0a0e9d16.poster.avif?t=1756515603\" width=800 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909810/extras/9fab49dc963b7c6b3ae71f5e0a0e9d16.webm?t=1756515603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909810/extras/9fab49dc963b7c6b3ae71f5e0a0e9d16.mp4?t=1756515603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 17-year-old urban explorer vanished after venturing into the city’s sewer system, leaving behind chilling footage of his final moments. The official report denied the existence of gators beneath the city—but his friends know the truth. Determined to expose the cover-up, they drop into a entrance located deep in the forest, they descend underground with cameras in hand, only to discover the exit sealed shut with a padlock. Trapped in the twisting tunnels, they must outwit deadly threats, solve puzzles, and unlock the gates to escape before they meet the same fate as their friend.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore, survive, and escape in this tense first-person horror experience—alone or with up to 3 friends online.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once inside, the only way out is to make it through. Navigate the maze of tunnels, solve environmental puzzles, and document your descent with your camera. But make too much noise, and you'll attract the attention of a massive, predatory gator that hunts anything that moves. It’s fast. It’s smart. And it knows these tunnels better than you ever will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909810/extras/2a26803669d4c74b6debf7218244be5e.poster.avif?t=1756515603\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909810/extras/2a26803669d4c74b6debf7218244be5e.webm?t=1756515603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909810/extras/2a26803669d4c74b6debf7218244be5e.mp4?t=1756515603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-Player and Online Co-op</strong><br>Play solo for a tense, immersive horror experience, or team up with up to four players in cooperative online multiplayer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sound-Triggered Predator</strong><br>The gator is always listening. Splashing in water, dropping items, even running can give away your location. Stay quiet, move carefully, or die trying.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Puzzle Solving</strong><br>Unlock new paths, restore power to locked areas, and work together (or alone) to escape this place.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Sewer Layouts</strong><br>With varying maps and randomized elements, every run is different. Learn from your mistakes—but don't expect the same path twice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Found-Footage Atmosphere</strong><br>Your only companion is your camera. Record your descent, piece together what happened here, and maybe leave behind something for the next unlucky soul.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the unknown. Stay quiet. Stay alive.</strong><br>Do you dare to find out what lies beneath?</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Syracuse Police Dept. Recovered Footage_012 **CLASSIFIED</strong>**</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909810/extras/9fab49dc963b7c6b3ae71f5e0a0e9d16.poster.avif?t=1756515603\" width=800 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909810/extras/9fab49dc963b7c6b3ae71f5e0a0e9d16.webm?t=1756515603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909810/extras/9fab49dc963b7c6b3ae71f5e0a0e9d16.mp4?t=1756515603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 17-year-old urban explorer vanished after venturing into the city’s sewer system, leaving behind chilling footage of his final moments. The official report denied the existence of gators beneath the city—but his friends know the truth. Determined to expose the cover-up, they drop into a entrance located deep in the forest, they descend underground with cameras in hand, only to discover the exit sealed shut with a padlock. Trapped in the twisting tunnels, they must outwit deadly threats, solve puzzles, and unlock the gates to escape before they meet the same fate as their friend.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore, survive, and escape in this tense first-person horror experience—alone or with up to 3 friends online.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once inside, the only way out is to make it through. Navigate the maze of tunnels, solve environmental puzzles, and document your descent with your camera. But make too much noise, and you'll attract the attention of a massive, predatory gator that hunts anything that moves. It’s fast. It’s smart. And it knows these tunnels better than you ever will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909810/extras/2a26803669d4c74b6debf7218244be5e.poster.avif?t=1756515603\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909810/extras/2a26803669d4c74b6debf7218244be5e.webm?t=1756515603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909810/extras/2a26803669d4c74b6debf7218244be5e.mp4?t=1756515603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-Player and Online Co-op</strong><br>Play solo for a tense, immersive horror experience, or team up with up to four players in cooperative online multiplayer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sound-Triggered Predator</strong><br>The gator is always listening. Splashing in water, dropping items, even running can give away your location. Stay quiet, move carefully, or die trying.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Puzzle Solving</strong><br>Unlock new paths, restore power to locked areas, and work together (or alone) to escape this place.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Sewer Layouts</strong><br>With varying maps and randomized elements, every run is different. Learn from your mistakes—but don't expect the same path twice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Found-Footage Atmosphere</strong><br>Your only companion is your camera. Record your descent, piece together what happened here, and maybe leave behind something for the next unlucky soul.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the unknown. Stay quiet. Stay alive.</strong><br>Do you dare to find out what lies beneath?</p>", "short_description": "Explore a hidden sewer beneath the forest in this tense survival horror game. Play solo or with friends, solve puzzles, stay quiet, and escape a maze of shifting tunnels while a deadly predator hunts you by sound. One wrong move—and you're not getting out.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909810/75f36fd8af9c4431a29f295bfbb7c4ffeca41a42/header.jpg?t=1756515603", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909810/e2adf5a134c563a242896b7cecde6f76a4544690/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756515603", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909810/e2adf5a134c563a242896b7cecde6f76a4544690/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756515603", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Untested<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> Untested MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Untested<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> Untested MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Untested<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> Untested MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Untested<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> Untested MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Mythroot Interactive"], "publishers": ["Mythroot Interactive"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"window